    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack\n- High chance of evading enemy's attack\n- Damage reduction rate 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- All allies' Ki +2 and ATK & DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g} for 2 turns\n*When attacking*\n- ATK & DEF 100%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 1st attacker in a turn*\n- All allies' Ki +2 and ATK 50%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 50%{passiveImg:up_g} before attacking\n*When attacking as the 1st attacker in a turn*\n- Attacks are effective against all Types\n- Interrupts the attacked enemy\n*As the 2nd or 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 30%{passiveImg:up_g} before receiving\nan attack\n*For every attack performed*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 200%)\n*When there is another \"GT Heroes\" or \"Bond of Friendship\"\nCategory ally attacking in the same turn*\n- Randomly changes Ki Spheres of a certain Type to Rainbow\nKi Spheres\n- Launches an additional Super Attack",
